cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "The Sortitude: Real-Time Waste Classification on a Google Coral Edge TPU"
abstract: >-
  A MobileNetV2 waste classifier (cardboard, glass, metal, paper, plastic,
  trash) trained on TrashNet, compressed to int8 and compiled for the Google
  Coral Edge TPU. The int8 model is 2.6 MB with 89.7% validation accuracy and
  runs at 3.09 ms per image on the Edge TPU, 42x faster than the board's CPU,
  with a live webcam dashboard running entirely on the device.
